label day_2_dawn (Day 2 Dawn - The Garden Held)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core": You came back.
"Dianthus Core": I know that sounds like a small thing. It is not. The dark counts every footstep that does not return — and last night, yours did.
"Dianthus Core": The soil remembers now. Where you walked, it holds a little warmer. The garden is starting to learn your shape, little alchemist.
[signal arg="day_2_dawn_done"]
[end_timeline]

label first_plant_monologue (First Plant Placed - Internal Monologue)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Pixie" (Thought): The soil warms around it — as if the garden has been waiting to be touched without fear.
"Pixie" (Thought): Something is listening to me here. Not with words. With roots.
[signal arg="first_plant_monologue_done"]
[end_timeline]

label dusk_forest_entry (First Dusk Forest Entry)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core": The forest remembers night differently. Not as enemy — as habit. It was born learning to breathe in the dark.
"Dianthus Core": The roots here are old. Some of them remember a time before the void pressed close. Listen to what they are still carrying.
"Pixie" (Thought): It grows in darkness, but it does not feel cruel. The dim light catches something soft in the leaves. Alive — differently alive.
[signal arg="dusk_forest_entry_done"]
[end_timeline]

label dusk_forest_unlocked (Dusk Forest Path Opened)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core": The Dusk Forest path has opened. The old road is awake — but the day is still yours. Go when you are ready.
[signal arg="dusk_forest_unlocked_done"]
[end_timeline]
